otta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"The Culprit Is Koro-nee","synopsis":"Love Rice arrives at the Harvest Festival with the goal of starting a rice riot with their performance, which they haven't once completed successfully in practice yet. Then Hinohikari tells the other members the reason he decided to become a HarveStar. But then the mood is broken when Hitomebore receives a phone call... Who's behind this?!","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12553","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"97862","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34402","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"321698","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"69686","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Chinkobozu Finally Has His Turn","synopsis":"Love Rice arrives at the Harvest Festival with the goal of starting a rice riot with their performance, which they haven't once completed successfully in practice yet. Then Hinohikari tells the other members the reason he decided to become a HarveStar. But then the mood is broken when Hitomebore receives a phone call... Who's behind this?!","titleLanguage":"eng","sy